{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_001har_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_2000_situation", "source_sha256": "51385aef536e54a296c43a54c533650bd0d066acea601ddf21e6d2c572b0c16e", "ja": "お料理番組のお仕事", "zh": "烹饪节目工作", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_001har_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_2000_place", "source_sha256": "2e32c611423df90ffdcd37956af5b67b223b0440bfed3735e47647a664060358", "ja": "TVスタジオ", "zh": "电视台摄影棚", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_001har_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_2001_001har", "source_sha256": "ab2ba5764e603a4ee7efec9e49cf534ecaca71860aaf4424b65664577d8ee6a5", "ja": "あの、{$P$}さん。\n突然ですけど、今日のお昼ご飯は……決まってますか？", "zh": "那个，{$P$}先生，抱歉我有个突然的\n问题：请问你今天的午饭……决定好要吃什么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_001har_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_2002_p", "source_sha256": "27ed0360ff7dbcca1f58e6e8135bdc97b598ccb0ff1feba70b3fb7663b0c916e", "ja": "え？　別に決まってないけど。\n急に、どうしたんだ？", "zh": "咦？是还没有决定啦。\n怎么突然问这个？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_001har_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_2003_001har", "source_sha256": "57ac97ae91a447a840d6d602bc8297622818aaf205767e8403dd6cae79234ec0", "ja": "ほら、私って来週、この局で\n料理番組の収録がありますよね？", "zh": "就是啊，我下周不是要在这家电视台\n录烹饪节目吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_001har_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_2004_001har", "source_sha256": "8cf263a2f91587f7b60c914a6b0845e79290cd80881393a3ccfcd757265cf575", "ja": "その練習をかねて、今朝お弁当を作ってみたんです。\nあとで……食べてみてもらえないかな～って……。", "zh": "所以我今天早上做了便当，顺便当作是练习。\n不晓得……晚点可不可以请你品尝看看呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_001har_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_2005_p", "source_sha256": "06a5d4a64eb6f47196d67db0376f984d98f7a638f56fe6faa87489e8635452b9", "ja": "へえ、春香の料理か。それは楽しみだな。\nもちろん、喜んでいただくよ。", "zh": "哦，春香做的菜啊，那真是让人期待。\n我当然很乐意品尝喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_001har_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_2006_001har", "source_sha256": "971f23dd9c65f099accf298bccdfd6ad504f50b1659532c3832e8f58497ff104", "ja": "わ、いいんですか！？　えへへ、まだあんまり自信は\nないんですけど……あ、玉子焼きは上手くいきました♪", "zh": "哇，真的吗！？嘿嘿，不过我还不是很有自信……\n啊，我煎蛋卷煎得很漂亮喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
